{
  "title": "CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "누가 호출했는지, 구성이 어떻게 바뀌었는지, 상태가 어떤지를 나눠 본다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#comparison\">비교표</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail Event History</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#trails-and-event-types\">Trails and Event Types</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-lake\">CloudTrail Lake</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#aws-config-recorder-and-timeline\">AWS Config Recorder and Timeline</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#config-rules-and-conformance-packs\">Config Rules and Conformance Packs</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch Metrics and Alarms</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-logs-and-logs-insights\">CloudWatch Logs and Logs Insights</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-agent-and-observability\">CloudWatch Agent and Observability</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>보안</span><span>10 / 62</span></div><h1>CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 8 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a>은 누가 어떤 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>를 호출했는지, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#aws-config-recorder-and-timeline\">Config</a>는 리소스 설정이 어떻게 변했는지, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch</a>는 시스템이 어떻게 동작하는지를 관찰한다. 이 세 관점은 사고 조사와 운영에서 서로 보완적이다.</p><p>API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 감사·설정 Compliance·성능 경보를 하나의 로그 기능으로 합쳐 생각하면 필요한 데이터가 빠진다. 수집 범위·보존·비용·권한을 각 서비스에서 설정한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"사고 조사에서 세 가지 증거\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>사고 조사에서 세 가지 증거</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Who and what changed</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a></strong><small>호출자·API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>·시각</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#aws-config-recorder-and-timeline\">AWS Config</a></strong><small>설정 이력·관계</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Investigation</strong><small>변경 전후 원인 확인</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>What users experienced</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch</a> Metrics</strong><small>Error·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Latency</a>·CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span></small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch</a> Logs</strong><small>앱·서비스 실행 기록</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Alarms / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboard</a></strong><small>운영 대응·상태 추적</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">OS Memory Metric은 기본 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> Metric 외에 Agent 등 수집이 필요하다.</p></div></figure></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"wiki-section\"><h2>비교표</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"비교표\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Service</th><th scope=\"col\">Question</th><th scope=\"col\">Typical output</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a></td><td>누가 어떤 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>를 호출했나?</td><td>Event / Trail</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#aws-config-recorder-and-timeline\">Config</a></td><td>설정이 무엇이며 규칙에 맞나?</td><td>Configuration / Compliance</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch</a></td><td>성능·로그·상태가 어떤가?</td><td>Metric / Log / Alarm</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cloudtrail-event-history\"><h2>CloudTrail Event History<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>별 최근 90일 Management Event를 조회한다. 모든 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> Object 읽기 같은 Data Event를 기본으로 모두 기록하는 것은 아니다. 장기 보존·전체 조직 감사에는 Trail 또는 지원 분석 저장을 구성한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"trails-and-event-types\"><h2>Trails and Event Types<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#trails-and-event-types\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Trail은 Event를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 등으로 전달하며 Multi-<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>·Organization Trail을 구성할 수 있다. Management·Data·지원 Network Activity Event의 범위와 비용을 구분한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a> Insights는 지원 비정상 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 활동을 분석한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cloudtrail-lake\"><h2>CloudTrail Lake<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-lake\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 Event를 저장·SQL 조회하는 관리형 분석 환경이다. Event Data Store의 수집·Retention·과금 조건을 확인한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> Log를 Athena로 분석하는 별도 방식과 목적·비용을 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"aws-config-recorder-and-timeline\"><h2>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Config Recorder and Timeline<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#aws-config-recorder-and-timeline\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>지원 리소스의 Configuration Item과 관계·변경 이력을 기록한다. 과거에 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>이 어떤 규칙이었는지 조사할 수 있다. Recorder의 리소스 범위·기록 빈도·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 설정을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"config-rules-and-conformance-packs\"><h2>Config Rules and Conformance Packs<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#config-rules-and-conformance-packs\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>Managed·Custom Rule로 원하는 설정에 부합하는지 평가한다. Conformance Pack은 Rule·Remediation을 묶고 Aggregator는 여러 계정·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 결과를 모은다. 평가만으로 변경을 사전 차단하는 것은 아니며 Remediation은 별도로 구성한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\"><h2>CloudWatch Metrics and Alarms<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#reference-3\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 3\">[3]</a></h2><p>Namespace·Dimension·Period·Statistic으로 지표를 해석한다. Alarm은 임계값·Anomaly·Composite 조건으로 알림·지원 Action을 실행한다. Missing Data 처리와 Evaluation Period를 잘못 설정하면 오탐이 생길 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cloudwatch-logs-and-logs-insights\"><h2>CloudWatch Logs and Logs Insights<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-logs-and-logs-insights\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#reference-3\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 3\">[3]</a></h2><p>Log Group·Stream에 앱·서비스 Log를 수집하고 Retention을 정한다. Logs Insights Query와 Metric Filter로 분석·경보를 연결한다. 민감한 값을 Log에 남기지 않도록 앱 수준 처리가 필요하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cloudwatch-agent-and-observability\"><h2>CloudWatch Agent and Observability<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-agent-and-observability\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#reference-3\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 3\">[3]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>의 Memory·Disk 사용 등 OS 내부 지표는 Agent 등 추가 수집이 필요하다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#dashboards-and-sharing\">Dashboard</a>, Synthetics, Application Signals 등으로 사용자·앱 관점을 확장한다. 기본 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span> Metric만으로 앱 정상 여부를 보장하지 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 삭제 사고에서는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a>로 호출자를, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#aws-config-recorder-and-timeline\">Config</a>로 이전 설정을, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch</a>로 장애 전후 Error·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Latency</a>를 함께 조사한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span> 사용률 경보를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a>로 만들거나 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 호출 감사를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch</a> 지표만으로 대신하지 않는다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/awscloudtrail/latest/userguide/cloudtrail-user-guide.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">awscloudtrail/latest/userguide/cloudtrail-user-guide.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/config/latest/developerguide/WhatIsConfig.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">config/latest/developerguide/WhatIsConfig.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/monitoring/WhatIsCloudWatch.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonCloudWatch/latest/monitoring/WhatIsCloudWatch.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q068/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q068\" data-question=\"Q068\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q068</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q068/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An administrator needs to audit who called an API to change an IAM policy. Which service should be checked first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The size of files in EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The S3 storage class</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudWatch CPU metrics</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a>은 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 활동 이력을 기록한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q069\" data-question=\"Q069\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q069</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q069/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants an alarm when EC2 CPU utilization exceeds a threshold. Which service provides the appropriate metrics and alarms?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q069\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only CloudTrail event history</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q069\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS KMS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q069\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only AWS Config rules</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q069\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudWatch</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch</a>가 지표 수집과 경보에 쓰인다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q070\" data-question=\"Q070\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q070</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q070/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to evaluate whether security group configurations remain compliant and track configuration changes. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q070\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q070\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q070\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q070\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Config</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#aws-config-recorder-and-timeline\">Config</a>는 리소스 구성 기록과 규정 준수 평가를 돕는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q012\" data-question=\"Q012\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q012</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q012/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which logical networking resource associated with an EC2 instance includes IP addresses and security groups?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>에는 프라이빗 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a> 등의 네트워크 속성이 연결된다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q062\" data-question=\"Q062\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q062</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q062/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A principal needs temporary access by assuming a role in another AWS account. Which API action is central to this design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 HealthCheck</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">STS AssumeRole</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only S3 PutObject</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EC2 AssociateAddress</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · AssumeRole은 역할의 임시 자격 증명을 얻는다. 양측 권한·신뢰 설정을 확인한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">이전 용어 <b>CloudFront</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">다음 용어 <b>DataSync / Snow Family</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
